Kronecker -- Kronecker and rational normal forms
************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides methods for computing the Kronecker and rational normal
forms of a matrix.

Author
======

  * Edward Carter <edward.carter@gmail.com>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.3.3 of Kronecker, released July 16,
2010.

