|i1 : Q = ZZ/101[x,y]                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Q                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = Q/(x^2,y^2)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = coker random(R^5, R^8 ** R^{-1})                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = cokernel | 24x-36y  -29x-24y -18x-13y 45x-34y  39x+43y  40x+11y 2x+29y  |
|              | -30x-29y -38x-16y -43x-15y -48x-47y -17x-11y 46x-28y -47x+15y|
|              | 19x+19y  39x+21y  -28x-47y 47x+19y  48x+36y  x-3y    -37x-13y|
|              | -10x-29y 34x+19y  38x+2y   -16x+7y  35x+11y  22x-47y -10x+30y|
|              | -8x-22y  -47x-39y 16x+22y  15x-23y  -38x+33y -23x-7y -18x+39y|
|                                                                             |
|                            5                                                |
|o3 : R-module, quotient of R                                                 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|27x-22y  |                                                                   |
|32x-9y   |                                                                   |
|-32x-20y |                                                                   |
|24x-30y  |                                                                   |
|-48x-15y |                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (N,f) = decomposeModule M                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = (cokernel | y x 0 0 0 0 0 0 |, | -25 -49 -25 15  1   |)                 |
|               | 0 0 x 0 y 0 0 0 |  | 28  -45 29  30  -39 |                  |
|               | 0 0 0 y x 0 0 0 |  | -16 43  -43 -47 -24 |                  |
|               | 0 0 0 0 0 x 0 y |  | -14 -37 25  -19 26  |                  |
|               | 0 0 0 0 0 0 y x |  | 1   0   0   0   0   |                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : components N                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {cokernel | y x |, cokernel | x 0 y |, cokernel | x 0 y |}              |
|                                 | 0 y x |           | 0 y x |               |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : ker f == 0                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : coker f == 0                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = true                                                                    |
