|                                                              |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = R^4                                                  |
|                                                              |
|      4                                                       |
|o2 = R                                                        |
|                                                              |
|o2 : R-module, free                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = random(M,M)                                          |
|                                                              |
|o3 = | 24  19  -8  -38 |                                      |
|     | -36 19  -22 -16 |                                      |
|     | -30 -10 -29 39  |                                      |
|     | -29 -29 -24 21  |                                      |
|                                                              |
|             4      4                                         |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : factor det(x*id_M - A)                                   |
|                                                              |
|       2              2                                       |
|o4 = (x  + 39x - 10)(x  + 27x - 27)                           |
|                                                              |
|o4 : Expression of class Product                              |
